  "ai.orion81Builds": "Orion-81 mmuenzeke pa software wa open-source wenzeka kudi bantu. Udi apa bualu kena wa AI.",
  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 mmudimu wenzeka bujima ne AI.<\/0> Mulongo wonso wa nsangilu wa Orion-81 yenyewu wafundibua ne Claude Code, wilongolola kudi muenzedi. Bwato bonso, mapa onso, tshifanyi tshionso ne dîyi dionso bienzeka ne bintu bia kuenza bifundila kudi Claude Code. Muenzedi udi musungule tshia kuenza; Claude Code udi umona muvuabu. Mabuku a open-source adi mmuenzeke pa awu adi mu mukanda wa panshi mu 'Wa bakuabu, kena wa AI'. Tshintu tshimue tshidi tshishala tshipua ne tshionesha pabuipi: <1>dikebesha dia dilesa<\/1> dia nsangilu wa muaku wapitshila kudi prototype wa GPL.",
  "ai.orionBegan28": "Orion wakatuadija dia 28 Setembre 2026 bu prototype pa engine ya open-source ya Quake III Arena (GPL), ne mabwato a mu Elite Dangerous bu tshiluilu tshia dibandisha. Mu dituku dia ibidi nsangilu wa muaku wapitshila pa BuB, engine mupia wafundibua ne Claude Code; bitupa bia muaku bipitshila kudi prototype ne bakabipesha mêna makuabu. Mushindu wa 0.3.0 wapesha mishindu yonso 16 ya mabwato mibidi mipia ya yawu yenyewu. Dikebesha dia kuteka mikenji ya dilesa didi ditangila patshidi nsangilu mukuabu wapatuka ku wa GPL wa kumpala, ne patshidi bifanyi bia kumpala bia mabwato bipetangane bikole ku tshiluilu tshiabi. Dikebesha dia nsangilu bua kumona kufanangana ne nsangilu wa prototype wa GPL dienzeka dia 8 Oktobre 2026, ne dikebesha dia bamanye bua bifananganyi bidiye dipetele didi mu kuenzeka. Tshionso tshidi tshipatuka kudi mukuabu nkutshifundila kabidi anyi kutshienzela tshishima tshipia.",
