  "economy.todayHead": "Tshidi tshidiko lelu",
  "economy.todayLead": "Mishindu ya mubidi ne ya ngabu ne ntuku ya ngabu ya tshibandi tshia LOADOUT (0.6.0) idi ileja mushindu wa dikolesha ne wa mulengu udi makuta atela bua kupesha.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Bualu makuta awu adi bua kubapa. Muaku udi utuadija wenzeka bujima ne AI bua wikale, kupua bantu benza bifanyi badi bapetu makuta badi baadimuna mudimu wa AI, ne dîna diabu.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Ndi mua kuenza pa internet?",
  "faq.freePlay": "Mmua kuvuala bualu anyi?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Mibelu",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Nsunga eyi nanku. Muaku wa bantu bavule pa LAN umue udi wenda lelu (kuambuluka ku 0.2.0); muaku pa internet kena wenzeka.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Prototype wakenzeka pa engine ya open-source ya Quake III Arena (GPL) ne mabwato a Elite Dangerous bu tshiluilu tshia dibandisha. Mu dituku dia ibidi nsangilu wa muaku wapitshila pa BuB, engine mupia wafundibua ne Claude Code; bitupa bia muaku bipitshila kudi prototype ne bakabipesha mêna makuabu. Mushindu wa 0.3.0 wapesha mishindu yonso 16 ya mabwato mibidi mipia. Dikebesha dia kuteka mikenji ya dilesa didi ditangila patshidi nsangilu mukuabu wapatuka ku wa GPL wa kumpala ne patshidi bifanyi bia kumpala bia mabwato bipetangane bikole ku tshiluilu tshiabi. Dikebesha dia nsangilu bua kumona kufanangana ne nsangilu wa prototype wa GPL dienzeka dia <0/>, ne dikebesha dia bamanye bua bifananganyi bidiye dipetele didi mu kuenzeka. Tshionso tshidi tshipatuka kudi mukuabu nkutshifundila kabidi anyi kutshienzela tshishima tshipia. Too ne pavua dikebesha dipua, katuena tuamba ne dilumbuluisha dia muaku wa kakuyi.",
  "faq.questions": "Mibelu",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Mabwato, bifanyi, interface ne bikuabu, bilondeshile makuta adi apetangana. <0>Mukanda wa pa tshibandi etshi<\/0> udi ubala tshintu tshionso ne uleja dikuadimuna dionso ne muenzedi wadiyi.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Mabwato ne dikolesha bidi bia kuenza bipetibua ne kuenza mapuku anyi kusumbibua. Muvuabu mabwato a makuta adi shala ne bulelela mu mvita ya muntu ne muntu mmu kuenzeka ntatu.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Ndiyi mushindu: muaku wa kuvuala bualu ne makuta a mu muaku a dilomba ne bintu bia mulengu. Kena wenzeka nsunga eyi.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Mudimu wa muntu wakopeshibua anyi?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Udi ulua padi, ne pa tshinyi?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Bitupa bionso bia mudimu bidi bantu babuedisha, ne ndi mua kumanya muvuabu?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "Bua tshinyi muaku wenzeka ne AI udi ukuatshisha bantu benza bifanyi?",
  "faq.willPayWin": "Mua kuikala wa kusumba bua kupeta anyi?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "Windows PC. Kakuena dituku dia dipatula ne mushinga kabidi nsunga eyi.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude ne Claude Code mbimanyinu bia Anthropic, PBC. Unreal Engine ne Epic Games mbimanyinu bia Epic Games, Inc. Blender mmumanyinu wa Blender Foundation. Quake III Arena ne Elite Dangerous mbimanyinu bia bantu badi nabi. Mêna onso mmia bantu badi nawu ne adi ela mudimu bua kumanyisha bintu bidi biambibua kamue. Orion-81 kena mu dikuatakana nabu, kena mutuadibua anyi mubatshikibua kudi bobo bonso.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Tshidi ditaya. Kakuena dikuatakana, dikuatshisha anyi dibatshika dienzeka.",
  "footer.channelComing": "Channel udi uya",
  "footer.devlogYoutube": "Devlog pa YouTube",
  "footer.followKickstarter": "Londa Kickstarter",
  "footer.futurePartners": "Bakuabu ba dilonda?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Kakuena trackers. Kakuena cookies. Webusaite wa dikanyisha. Tshionso tshidi tshibuelela ku archive wa mudimu; kakuena tshintu pa tshibandi etshi tshidi dipesha anyi dilaya.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Kayena muoyo",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Tshintu tshimue tshidi tshishala tshipua: <0>dikebesha dia dilesa<\/0> dia nsangilu wa muaku wapitshila kudi prototype wa GPL. Dikebesha dia nsangilu bua kumona kufanangana ne nsangilu wa prototype dienzeka dia <1/>, ne dikebesha dia bamanye bua bifananganyi bidiye dipetele didi mu kuenzeka.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 mmudimu wenzeka bujima ne AI.<\/0> Nsangilu wa Orion-81 yenyewu wa Claude Code, wilongolola kudi muenzedi; mabwato, mapa, bifanyi bia pa nshi ne dîyi bienzeka ne bintu bia kuenza bifundila kudi Claude Code. Mabuku a open-source adi mmuenzeke pa awu adi mu <1>'Wa bakuabu, kena wa AI'<\/1>.",
  "footer.siteFooterAriaLabel": "Panshi pa webusaite",
  "hero.behindThisPlate": "Panyima pa tshifanyi etshi: mufanyi wa ORION-1 wa mu muaku wa mushindu 0.6.1, udi muonekela pa kabidi mu browser webe (wapetuluka bua web, tshifanyi tshipepeshibua too ne 512 px).",
  "hero.behindThisPlate2": "Panyima pa tshifanyi etshi: tshifanyi tshia mu muaku wa mushindu 0.6.1. 3D wa kusumbuka udi mujikile pa tshishima etshi.",
  "hero.exploreShips": "Tangila mabwato",
  "hero.followKickstarter": "Londa Kickstarter",
  "hero.groundedSixDegrees": "Mvita ya mu diulu ya bukole, ya njila isambombo ya kuenda, kutuadija ku bwato bua mvita bua 12 m too ku bwato bukulu bua 1.2 km.",
  "hero.n100AiGenerated": "100 % WENZEKA NE AI  ·  0 % WA MUNTU NE LELU",
  "hero.notLiveYet": "Kayena muoyo",
  "hero.oneItemStill": "Tshintu tshimue tshidi tshishala tshipua ne tshionesha pabuipi: <0>dikebesha dia dikuatshisha dia nsangilu wa muaku wapitshila kudi prototype wa GPL<\/0>.",
